[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0203","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0227","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2.x Unix域套接字本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2.x 内核未对 Unix 域套接字数量进行有效限制，未授权本地攻击者可通过不断创建大量套接字耗尽系统资源，从而触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.2.12/2.2.14/2.3.99 及 RedHat 6.x 等版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，属于本地提权类拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0227"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16.173","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.0 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 2.4.0 内核中修复），或安装对应发行版的安全补丁（如 RedHat 6.x 的 errata 更新）。对于无法升级内核的遗留系统，可通过 sysctl 调整 net.core.wmem_max 参数限制单进程 socket 占用上限，并监控异常 socket 创建行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0254.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95421263519558&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19818","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0227","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0227.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9q58-rgq9-hrfr/GHSA-9q58-rgq9-hrfr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb