Server 7.0 或更高版本。若暂时无法迁移，在管理界面中禁用 Directory Indexing 功能，并关闭 Web Publishing 扩展模块，同时在服务器配置中禁止 OPTIONS 方法。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1063","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=38D2173D.24E39DD0%40relaygroup.com"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0210","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0231","title":"Linux kreatecd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统下的 kreatecd 工具存在权限提升漏洞，该工具盲目信任用户提供的路径参数来定位 cdrecord 程序，未对路径进行充分校验。本地攻击者可通过设置恶意路径替换合法的 cdrecord 程序，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Halloween Linux 4.0 以及 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.0/6.1/6.2/6.3 等多个发行版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0231"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16.747","remediation":"建议移除 kreatecd 的 setuid 权限位（执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/kreatecd），或升级到 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.4 及以上版本。如无法升级，可将 cdrecord 路径硬编码为 /usr/bin/cdrecord 并确保该路径不可被普通用户写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0162.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1061","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19813","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0231.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0231","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0231.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0231.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/