/ows/bin/ 目录下的所有 .bat/.sh 文件，并限制 ows-bin 目录的 HTTP 访问权限（仅允许本地回环地址 127.0.0.1 访问）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q1/0211.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0169","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0169.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2cp-x56j-p654/GHSA-j2cp-x56j-p654.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/ows_bin_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0169.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0169.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1202"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0520.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0217","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0239","title":"Atrium Software Mercur WebView WebMail 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur WebView WebMail 1.0 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 WebMail 服务器发送包含超长 mail_user 参数的 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WebView WebMail-Client 1.0 版本，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0239"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17.810","remediation":"建议立即升级 Mercur WebView WebMail 至最新版本；若产品已停止维护，应迁移至仍在安全更新范围内的邮件 Web 客户端（如 Roundcube 或 SquirrelMail）。同时，在反向代理层（Nginx/Apache）配置规则，限制 `mail_user` GET 参数长度不超过 256 字符，过滤畸形请求。在 WAF 上添加规则拦截超长 `mail_user` 参数的攻击负载。临时缓解措施：将服务访问限制在可信 IP 段内，减少暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95325335825295&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1056","http://www.ussrback.com/labs36.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19810","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0239","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0239.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5gjw-82fr-pgpf/GHSA-5gjw-82fr-pgpf.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mercure_webview.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0239.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1056/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0217.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0217.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0175","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0198","title":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.2 POP3和IMAP服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Mercur Mail Server 3.2 的 POP3 和 IMAP 邮件服务组件中存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器的 POP3 或 IMAP 端口发送特制的大量数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mercur Mail Server 3.2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0198"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-15T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.360","remediation":"建议立即升级至 MERCUR Mail Server 4.0 或更高版本（如仍可获得），该版本修复了 POP3 和 IMAP 服务中的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 Atrium Software 已停止运营，该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 hMailServer、Dovecot 等）。作为临时缓解措施，可在防火墙限制对 TCP 端口 110（POP3）和 143（IMAP）的访问，仅允许受信任的内网 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/current/0137.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/current/0206.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1051","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19807","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0198.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0198","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0